<title>USA: PSE to list Invacare, Valmont options.</title>
<headline>PSE to list Invacare, Valmont options.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pacific Stock Exchange (PSE) said Tuesday it will list options on Invacare Corp and Valmont Industries Inc on Wednesday, December 18.</p>
<p>The exchange said Invacare options will have opening strike prices of 25, 30 and 35. Valmont will have opening strikes of 30, 35 and 40.</p>
<p>Both options will open with expirations in January, February, March and June.</p>
<p>Group One Trading LP has been allocated Invacare options and Valmont options will trade in the Lockheed Martin Corp crowd. ((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
</text>
